---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-02 - Send Account-Linking Emails
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AccountsController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant E as IEmailService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Select accounts and click "Send linking email"
    W->>C: POST /api/Accounts/linking-emails {accountIds}
    C->>S: SendLinkingEmailsAsync(request)
    loop each account that is not linked
        S->>S: Create a random token, store only its SHA-256 hash, expiry = now + 7 days
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate(account) with linkStatus = emailSent
        S->>E: SendAccountLinkingEmailAsync(email, fullName, token)
    end
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE ACCOUNTS
    S-->>C: SendLinkingEmailResponse (sent, skipped)
    C-->>W: 200 OK
